post-it: Mouse glitches
symptoms:
	Slow to boot
		shows: Windows boots slower than a healthy computer
		category: At startup
	Mouse pointer jumps
		shows: the mouse skips when moved
		category: In Windows
	Folders open slowly
		shows: a folder takes about 2 seconds to open
checks:
	Windows starts quickly
		shows: the Windows splash screen lasts three times as long
	Folders open at once
		shows: a folder takes 2 seconds to open
software steps:
	Go to settings
	Start defrag
	Wait one day
	OK defrag result
notes:
	WILL TAKE UNTIL EVENING NEXT DAY
